{"id":"fab9ed41cc227c08","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-infinitary-semantics.md","title":"分支语言的标准解释与算术展开","display":"df-infinitary-semantics — 分支语言的标准解释与算术展开","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-infinitary-semantics","aliases":["18-df-infinitary-semantics"],"display":"df-infinitary-semantics — 分支语言的标准解释与算术展开","depends_on":["[[18-df-infinitary-operations]]","[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 8.2.1 and following arithmetic translation","source_pages":"132–133","source_pdf_pages":"142–143","verification_status":"source-definition-and-local-construction-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-infinitary-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-infinitary-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-semantics — 分支语言的标准解释与算术展开"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"392bd14777be34cd\" href=\"?note=392bd14777be34cd\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-operations\">18-df-infinitary-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 8.2.1 and following arithmetic translation"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"132–133"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"142–143"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-local-construction-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\">\\(0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\\)</span>；带标签构造及操作见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"392bd14777be34cd\" href=\"?note=392bd14777be34cd\" title=\"18-df-infinitary-operations\">18-df-infinitary-operations</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:\\mathcal V\\to\\omega\">\\(\\eta:\\mathcal V\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N},\\eta_0,\\overline n\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N},\\eta_0,\\overline n\\)</span> 和算术捕获避免代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty\\)</span> 在原始模板的良基构造上递归；全域赋值可限制到公式的有限自由参数集。</p>\n<p>算术展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\mapsto G^*\">\\(G\\mapsto G^*\\)</span> 的域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>，值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span>；在算术逻辑构造数上递归。量词分支先把其绑定数变量换成闭数项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\mathsf a(A),\\eta,\\Phi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(A,\\eta,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\eta,\\Phi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F_\\xi,\\eta,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\eta,\\Phi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F_\\xi,\\eta,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty F[\\Phi]&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F,\\eta_0,\\Phi)\\qquad(F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\mathsf a(A),\\eta,\\Phi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(A,\\eta,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\eta,\\Phi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F_\\xi,\\eta,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\eta,\\Phi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\xi&lt;\\lambda\\ \\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F_\\xi,\\eta,\\Phi),\\\\\n\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty F[\\Phi]&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F,\\eta_0,\\Phi)\\qquad(F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a(A),\\\\\n(G\\land H)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_2(\\langle G^*,H^*\\rangle),\\\\\n(G\\lor H)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_2(\\langle G^*,H^*\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\ G)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega(\\langle(G[x:=\\overline n])^*\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\ G)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\omega(\\langle(G[x:=\\overline n])^*\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf a(A),\\\\\n(G\\land H)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf C_2(\\langle G^*,H^*\\rangle),\\\\\n(G\\lor H)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_2(\\langle G^*,H^*\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\forall x\\ G)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf C_\\omega(\\langle(G[x:=\\overline n])^*\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\exists x\\ G)^*&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf D_\\omega(\\langle(G[x:=\\overline n])^*\\mid n&lt;\\omega\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\sim_\\infty F,\\eta,\\Phi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F,\\eta,\\Phi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(\\sim_\\infty F,\\eta,\\Phi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(F,\\eta,\\Phi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\quad\n\\bigl(G^*\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(G^*)=\\mathrm{FV}_0(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(G^*)=\\mathrm{FV}_1(G)\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(G^*,\\eta,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(G,\\eta,\\Phi)\\bigr)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall G\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\quad\n\\bigl(G^*\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(G^*)=\\mathrm{FV}_0(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(G^*)=\\mathrm{FV}_1(G)\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty(G^*,\\eta,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N}(G,\\eta,\\Phi)\\bigr)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(G^*\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\land\n(\\mathbb N\\models G[\\Phi]\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty G^*[\\Phi])\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(G^*\\in\\mathcal L_{\\omega_1}\\land\n(\\mathbb N\\models G[\\Phi]\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models_\\infty G^*[\\Phi])\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭数公式部分逐项对应 Definition 8.2.1，算术展开对应印刷133页的星号翻译。原书全域赋值与仅在有限 FV 上赋值等价，因为递归式只读取实际出现的变量。空合取为真、空析取为假；数值原子的语义由已有标准求值决定。</p>\n<p>满足关系和对偶规律由良基构造递归及归纳得到。展开递归用逻辑构造数：虽然量词体的闭数项实例不一定是原树字面子树，其逻辑构造数仍严格小于外面的量词式。自由变量等式按语法归纳，量词分支使用数项代入引理；没有“默认数变量赋值”改变闭公式含义。展开的每个分支可数，有限支持不变，故输出确属所声明语言。无需把本地有限公式秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rk}_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\mathrm{rk}_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span> 与分支序数秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\">\\(\\mathrm{rnk}_\\infty\\)</span> 认作同一个函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-infinitary-operations","status":"resolved","id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-infinitary-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-infinitary-operations","status":"resolved","id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}$，$0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1$；带标签构造及操作见 [[18-df-infinitary-operations]]。$\\eta:\\mathcal V\\to\\omega$、$\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$。$\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm N},\\eta_0,\\overline n$ 和算术捕获避免代入见 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]。$\\mathrm{Sat}_\\infty$ 在原始模板的良基构造上递归；全域赋值可限制到公式的有限自由参数集。",